    "mulaIast": "avidyāyā āśrayastu śuddhaṃ brahmaiva | taduktam-\n\nāśrayatvaviṣayatvabhāginī nirvibhāgacitireva kevalā |\npūrvasiddhatamaso hi paścimo nāśrayo bhavati nāpi gocaraḥ ||\n\ndarpaṇasya mukhamātrasambandhe'pi pratimukhe mālinyavat pratibimbe jīve saṃsāraḥ, na bimbe brahmaṇi, upādheḥ pratibimbapakṣapātitvāt | nanu kathaṃ caitanyamajñānāśrayaḥ? tasya prakāśasvarūpatvāt, tayośca tamaḥprakāśavadviruddhasvabhāvatvāditi- cenna, ajñānavirodhi jñānaṃ hi na caitanyamātram, kintu vṛttipratibimbitam, tacca nāvidyāśrayaḥ, yaccāvidyāśrayaḥ, tacca nājñānavirodhi | na ca tarhi śuddhacito'jñānavirodhitvābhāve ghaṭādivadaprakāśatvāpattiḥ, vṛttyavacchedena tasyā evājñānavirodhitvāt, svatastṛṇatūlādibhāsakasya saurālokasya sūryakāntāvacchedena svabhāsyatṛṇatūlādidāhakatvavat svato'vidyātatkāryabhāsakasya caitanyasya vṛttyavacchedena naddāhakatvāt | nanu ahamajña iti dharmigrāhakeṇi sākṣiṇā ahaṅkārāśritatvenājñānasya grahaṇād bādhaḥ, na ca sthaulyāśrayadehaikyādhyāsādahaṃ sthūla iti vadajñānāśrayacidaikyādhyāsād dagdhṛtvāyasorekāgnisambandhādayo dahatī'tivadajñānāhaṅkārayorekacidaikyādhyāsādvā `ahamajña'iti dhīrbhrānteti vācyam, cito'jñānāśrayatvāsiddhyā anyonyāśrayāditi cenna, ahaṅkārasyāvidyādhīnatvena tadanāśrayatayā cita evājñānāśrayatve siddhe `ahamajña' iti pratīteraikyādhyāsanibandhanatvenābādhakatvāt | na ca avidyāśrayatvādevāhaṅkāro'kalpito'stu, kalpita eva vā tadāśrayatvamastu avidyāyāmanupapatteralaṅkāratvāditi vācyam, ahamarthasya jñānanivartyatvena dṛśyatvenākalpitatvāyogāt, cinmātrāśritatvaṃ vinātadgocaracaramavṛttyanivartyatvāpātāt, svakalpitasya svāśritatvena svāśrayatvāyogāt | na cāvidyāyāmanupapattiralaṅkāraḥ, anupapattimātraṃ nālaṅkāraḥ, kintu sattvādiprāpakayuktāvanupapattiḥ, anyathā vādivacaso'navakāśāpatteḥ | nanu- `niraniṣṭo niravadyaḥ śokaṃ mohamatyeti nityamukta' iti śrutivirodhāt na śuddhacito'vidyāśrayatvam, na hi mauḍhyaṃ na doṣaḥ, nāpi bandhakājñānāśrayo muktaḥ | na ca tāttvikāvidyādereva niṣedhaḥ, tvanmate tasyāprasakteḥ, jīve'pi tadabhāvena jīvabrahmaṇoḥ sāvadyatvaniravadyatvavyavasthāśrutivirodha iti cenna, avadyasya citi kāryakāritvābhāvena kāryakaratvākaryakāratvābhyāmeva sāvadyatvaniravadyatvavyavasthopapatteḥ, upādheḥ pratibimbapakṣapātitvāt | na ca cinmātrasyāvidyāśrayatve pramāṇābhāvaḥ, jīvāśritatve ca pramāṇamastīti vācyam, `māyāṃ tu prakṛtiṃ vidyānmāyinaṃ tu maheśvara'miti śrutereva pramāṇatvāt | na ca `jñājñāvīśānīśā'viti jīvājñānapratipādakaśrutivirodhaḥ, tadāśrayatvābhāve'pi tatkāryayogitayā ajñatvavyapadeśopapatteḥ | na ca brahmaṇo'pi jīvāśritājñānaviṣayatvena māyitvopapattiriti vācyam, jīvatvasyāśrayatāvacchedakatve parasparāśrayaprasaṅgāt |\n\nnanu- śuktyādyajñānavat jñāturarthāprakāśarūpamidamapyajñānaṃ svakāryeṇa bhrāntyādinā svanivartakena tattvajñānādinā svasamānayogakṣemeṇa jñānaprāgabhāvena ca sāmānādhikaraṇyāya jñātrātmaniṣṭham, na tu caitanyarūpajñānamātrāśritamiti cet, na, caitanyasyaiva jñātṛtvena jñāturarthāprakāśarūpatvasya samyak jñānāśrayatvasya bhrāntyādisāmānādhikaraṇyasya copapatteḥ | na caivaṃ jñātṛtve satyavidyāśrayatvam, avidyāyāṃ ca jñātṛtvamityanyonyāśraya iti vācyam, avidyāyā jñātṛtvānapekṣatvenānyonyāśrayābhāvāt | na hi sāmānādhikaraṇyamastītyetāvataiva tadapekṣayā anayā bhavitavyam | na ca- śarīre'pi jñātṛtvādhyasasambhavena tatrāpyajñānāśrayatvāpattiriti vācyam, na hi jñātṛtvādhyāso ajñānāśrayatve prayojakaḥ, yena tanmātreṇa tadāpadyeta, kintu prasaktaprakāśatvaṃ ajñānānaśritatvaṃ ca | na caivaṃ avidyāśrayasya jñātṛtvabhoktṛtvādimattve jīvāśritājñānapakṣapraveśa iti- vācyam, avidyāvacchinnasya hi jñātṛtvam, avidyā ca nāvidyāvacchedena, sāmānādhikaraṇyaṃ cāvacchedyāṃśaikyamādāya | yathopādhisambanadho mukhamātra eva, aupādhikamālinyasambandhastu upādhyavacchinne, bimbapratibimbayoraikyāt, tathā sāmānādhikaraṇyamapi | yathā pratibimbo na vastvantaraṃ, tathā vakṣyate | nanu- śuktyajñānamapi śuktyavacchinnacaitanyagataṃ vācyam, tathā ca `ahaṃ jānāmīcchāmī'tivad `ahaṃ na jānāmīti jñātṛsthatvānubhavavirodha iti cenna, ajñānadvaividhyāt | ekaṃ hi śuktyavacchinnacaitanyāśritaṃ tadgatāparokṣabhramajanakaṃ tadviṣayāparokṣapramānāśyam, aparaṃ ca parokṣabhramajanakaṃ tadviṣayapramāmātranāśyam pramātṛtvaprayojakopādhyavacchinnacaitanyāśritamityuktaṃ prāk | tatra pramātṛtvaprayojakopādhyavacchinnacaitanyagatājñānaviṣayako'yamanubhavaḥ | tena pramātṛtiṣṭhatvaviṣayatāsya na virudhyate | ata eva viṣayagatā'jñāne vidyamāne'pi pramātṛgatājñānanāśena na jānāmīti vyavahārābhāvaḥ |'"
