    "mulaIast": "anumānaṃ ca- ahamarthaḥ, anātmā, ahaṃpratyayaviṣayatvāt, śarīravat | na cāhamarthāntargatādhiṣṭhānabhūtacito'pi tatpratyayaviṣayatvāt tatra vyabhicāraḥ, yena rupeṇāhampratyayaviṣayatā, tena rūpeṇa tasyāpyanātmatvāt svarūpeṇāhampratyayaviṣayatvābhāvānna vyabhicāraḥ | ahamarthaḥ, ātmānyaḥ, ahaṃśabdābhidheyatvāt, ahaṃkāraśabdābhidheyavat | na cātrāsiddhiḥ, paryāyatāyā darśitatvāt | na ca- tvayāpyātmano gauro'hamityanātmāropādhiṣṭhānatvaṃ, mā na bhūvaṃ bhūyāsamityādinā paramapremāspadatvaṃ, ahamarthasya svasattāyāṃ prakāśāvyabhicāreṇātmanaḥ svaprakāśatvaṃ coktam, tatsarvamahamarthasyānātmatve na yuktaṃ syāditi- vācyam, idama ivādhiṣṭhānāvacchedakatvenādhiṣṭhānatvokteḥ | paramapremāspadatvamahamarthe ātmaikyāropāt | na caivamanyonyāśrayaḥ, suṣuptikālīnaprakāśāprakāśābhyāṃ vaidharmyeṇa bhedasādhanāt | na cāhamarthapremṇo'nyasya premṇo'nanubhavaḥ, parāmarśasiddhasuṣuptikālīnatādṛśapremānubhavasya sattvāt | na ca ahite hitabuddhyā premotpattidarśane'pi apremāspade pramāspadatāropo na dṛṣṭa iti- vācyam, ahamarthe ātmaikyāropanibandhanaṃ premāspadatvam, na tu svābhāvikamiti brūmaḥ, na tu premāspadatvāropam | ahamarthātmanorbhede'pi ahamarthasya prakāśāvyabhicāraḥ svaprakāśātmasambandhaṃ vinā na ghaṭata iti so'pi tatra pramāṇamiti nāyuktileśo'pi | na ca-\n\nsamāropyasya rūpeṇa viṣayo rūpavān bhavet |\nviṣayasya tu rūpeṇa samāropyaṃ na rūpavat ||\n\niti vācaspatyukterantaḥkaraṇagatāpremāspadatvasyaivātmani pratītyāpattiriti- vācyam, kimadhiṣṭhānagatadharmasyāropye'bhānamāpādyate? āropyagatadharmasyādhiṣṭhāne bhānaṃ vā? nādyaḥ, yaddharmavattayā jñāyamāne adhiṣṭhāne āropyanivṛttistasyaivāropye'bhānaniyamena prakṛte tadabhāvāt | na dvitīyaḥ, adhiṣṭhānagatadharmapratītyavirodhinaḥ āropyagatasyādhiṣṭhāne bhāne'pi prakṛte avirodhāt | ātmaikyādhyāsakāla eva premāspadatvasambhavenāropye'pi apremāspadatvāpratīteḥ kuto viṣaye tatpratītiḥ? yathā idamiti rajatādhyāsakāla eva rajate anidantvāpratītiḥ | yattu- kaiścit parihriyate- sukhānubhavarūpasyātmano ahamarthāt bhedenaiva sukhamanubhavāmītyādau pratītiḥ- iti, tanna, vaiṣayikasukhānubhavasyātmānyatvāt | na ca- mokṣe ahamarthābhāvenātmanāśo mokṣa iti bāhyamatāpattiḥ, premāspadasyāhamarthasya tvanmate'pi nāśāt, tadanyasya śūnyasya tanmate'pyanāśāditi- vācyam; aupādhikapremāspadanāśena bāhyamatapraveśāpattau śarīranāśe'pi tadāpatteḥ | etāvatāhamarthasya muktyananvaye'pi `māmamṛtaṃ kṛdhi' `jyotirahaṃ virajā vipāpmā bhūyāsamiti śrutirapi caitanyagatamevāmṛtatvaṃ viṣayīkaroti, `ahaṃ puṣṭaḥ syā'mitīccheva svasamayavidyamānaśarīravṛttipuṣṭim | na ca- `śarīraṃ puṣṭaṃ syā'diti śarīramātre puṣṭīcchāvad `ātmamātraṃ muktaṃ syā'ditīcchāyā adarśanena mukteraniṣṭatvāpattiriti- vācyam; icchāsamaye antaḥkaraṇādhyāsasambhavena yadyapi nātmamātragatamuktīcchā, tathāpi viśiṣṭagatamuktīcchāyā eva vivakṣitavivekena viśeṣyamātragatamuktiviṣayatvaparyavasānāt tasyāmiṣṭatvopapatteḥ | na cāhamarthasyāntaḥkaraṇagranthitve `mama mana iti dhīrna syāt; cidacidgranthirahaṅkāraḥ, acinmātramantaḥkaraṇam iti bhedena ṣaṣṭhyupapatteḥ | na caivaṃ- `manaḥ sphurati mano'stī' tyādijñānādahamiti jñānasya vaiṣamyānubhavo na syāt, cidacitsambalanaviṣayatvāviśeṣāditi- vācyam, saṃvalanaṃ hi na sambandhamātram, kintu tādātmyena pratibhāsaḥ | sa ca tatra nāstīti viśeṣāt |\n\nnanu- sarvāpi bhrāntirdvyaṃśaviṣayā; anyathā niradhiṣṭhānakabhramāpatteḥ, na ca `aha'miti buddheḥ dvyaṃśatvamanubhūyate | kalpyate cet, ātmeti buddherapi dvyaṃśatvaṃ kalpyatāmiti- cenna, kimidaṃ dvyaṃśaviṣayatvam? adhiṣṭhānāropyaviṣayatvaṃ cettarhīṣṭāpattiḥ, ahamarthamithyātvasyaiva dvitīyāṃśaviṣayatve pramāṇatvāt | ātmetyatra tu dvyaṃśaviṣayatve naivaṃ pramāṇamasti, yena tathā kalpyate | na ca dvyaṃśaviṣayatvaṃ bhinnabhinnaprakārāvacchinnāropyaviṣayatvam, rajatatvasaṃsargāropanibandhanedaṃrajatamiti pratītau vyabhicārāt | na hi rajatatve'pi tatra kaścana prakāro bhāsate, rajatādestatra prakāratvakalpane mānābhāvāt, tatkalpanāṃ vinaivopapatteḥ, tathā kalpanāyāmatiprasaṅgādaprayojakatvācca | yadvā- atrāpi `ahaṃ sphurāmi' `ahamasmī'ti dvyaṃśatā bhātyeva `rūpyaṃ sphurati' `rūpyamastītyatreva | iyāṃstu viśeṣaḥ- yattatra idaṃtvāvacchinnasphuraṇamadhiṣṭhānamiti idaṃ rūpyamiti dhīḥ, iha tu sphuraṇamātramadhiṣṭhānamiti sphurāmītyeva buddhiḥ | na ca bhramasyāpyadhyastatvenādhiṣṭhānatvāyogaḥ, bhrānto'si, sphuraṇaṃ caitanyaṃ brūmaḥ, na tvavidyāvṛttyādikam | evaṃ ca na pratyakṣamahamarthasyātmatve pramāṇam |\n\nnāpyanumānam | tathā hi- ahamartho, mokṣānvayī, tatsādhanakṛtyāśrayatvāt, sammatavad- ityatra viśeṣavyāptau dṛṣṭāntābhāvaḥ | na hi kṛtyāśraye mokṣānvayitvaṃ kvacit sampratipannamasti | sāmānyavyāpteḥ svargasādhanakṛtyāśraye ṛtviji svargānanvayena vyabhicārāt | ahamarthaḥ, anarthanivṛttyāśrayaḥ, anarthāśrayatvāt, sammatavadityatra śarīre vyabhicāraḥ | na ca tatrānarthāśrayatvamasiddham, `ahamajña' iti pratītyā ahamīva `sthūlo'hamajña' iti pratītyā śarīre'pi tatsattvād, anyathā asiddhiprasaṅgāt | anātmatvaṃ, nāhamarthavṛtti, anātmamātravṛttitvād, ghaṭatvavadityatra kṛtyāśrayāvṛttitvamupādhiḥ, | nāpi `kasminnvahamutkrānte utkrānto bhaviṣyāmi kasminvā pratiṣṭhite pratiṣṭhāsyāmi' `sa prāṇamasṛjata hantāhamimāstisro devatā' ityādau jagatkāraṇe sati prāṇamanaḥsṛṣṭeḥ pūrvamahaṃtvokteḥ, `tadātmānamevāved ahaṃ brahmāsmītyavadhāraṇena śuddhātmano'hantvokteḥ, anavadyasya brahmaṇo'hamullekhokteḥ, `ahamityeva yo vedyaḥ sa jīva iti kīrtitaḥ | sa duḥkhī sa sukhī caiva sa pātraṃ bandhamokṣayoḥ ||' ityādau mokṣānvayokteścaitāḥ śrutayaḥ pramāṇam, viśiṣṭavācakasyaivāhampadasya lakṣaṇayā niṣkṛṣṭāhaṅkāracaitanye prayogāt | lakṣaṇābījabhūtā'nupapattiruktā | etena- `māmeva ye prapadyante' ityādismṛtayo'pi- vyākhyātāḥ | ata eva `tadyo'haṃ so'sā' vityādāvapi lakṣaṇā''śrayaṇīyā, viśiṣṭavācakatvena klṛptasya viśeṣye lakṣaṇāyā āvaśyakatvāt |\n\n|| ityadvaitasiddhāvahamarthasyānātmatvopapattiḥ ||"
